---
import "katex/dist/katex.min.css";
import "../../src/styles/tokens.css";
import "../../src/styles/prose.css";
import "./studio.css";

const token = process.env.CONTENT_STUDIO_TOKEN ?? "";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN" data-theme="light">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>内容工作台 · 砚边</title>
  </head>
  <body class="studio-body document-theme">
    <div class="studio-shell">
      <header class="studio-header">
        <div class="studio-brand">
          <span class="studio-seal" aria-hidden="true">砚</span>
          <div>
            <strong>砚边</strong>
            <span>内容工作台</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="studio-header-status" aria-live="polite">
          <span id="dirty-status" class="status-pill is-clean">已保存</span>
          <button id="check-status" class="status-button" type="button">尚未校验</button>
        </div>
        <div class="studio-header-actions">
          <button id="run-check" class="button button-quiet" type="button">运行检查</button>
          <button id="theme-toggle" class="icon-button" type="button" title="切换主题" aria-label="切换主题">◐</button>
          <button id="save-entry" class="button button-primary" type="button" disabled>保存</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="mobile-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="工作区视图">
        <button class="is-active" data-mobile-pane="editor" type="button">编辑</button>
        <button data-mobile-pane="preview" type="button">预览</button>
      </div>

      <div class="studio-workspace" data-mobile-view="editor">
        <aside class="content-sidebar" aria-label="内容导航">
          <div class="sidebar-create">
            <button type="button" data-create="note"><span>＋</span> 笔记</button>
            <button type="button" data-create="essay"><span>＋</span> 随笔</button>
            <button type="button" data-create="course"><span>＋</span> 课程</button>
          </div>
          <label class="search-field">
            <span class="sr-only">搜索内容</span>
            <input id="catalog-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索标题、标签或 ID" autocomplete="off" />
          </label>
          <div class="catalog-filters" aria-label="发布状态筛选">
            <button type="button" class="is-active" data-filter="all">全部</button>
            <button type="button" data-filter="draft">草稿</button>
            <button type="button" data-filter="published">已发布</button>
          </div>
          <nav id="catalog-list" class="catalog-list" aria-live="polite">
            <p class="sidebar-message">正在读取内容…</p>
          </nav>
        </aside>

        <main class="editor-pane">
          <section id="welcome-panel" class="welcome-panel">
            <p class="eyebrow">LOCAL CONTENT STUDIO</p>
            <h1>从一页清晰的表单开始写作。</h1>
            <p>选择左侧已有内容，或创建一篇新的课程笔记、随笔与课程。所有内容都会直接保存到当前仓库。</p>
            <div id="welcome-stats" class="welcome-stats"></div>
          </section>

          <section id="entry-editor" class="entry-editor" hidden>
            <div class="entry-heading">
              <div>
                <div class="entry-kicker">
                  <span id="entry-kind-label">课程笔记</span>
                  <span id="readonly-badge" class="readonly-badge" hidden>MDX 只读</span>
                </div>
                <h1 id="entry-heading-title">未命名内容</h1>
                <p id="entry-path" class="entry-path">尚未保存</p>
                <a id="entry-site-path" class="entry-site-path" href="#" hidden></a>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div id="readonly-notice" class="notice" hidden>
              这是 MDX 文件。v1 会保留并展示内容，但请使用代码编辑器修改含组件的正文。
            </div>
            <div id="slug-notice" class="notice notice-soft" hidden>
              当前文章 ID 含有非英文字符，可以正常使用；若希望 URL 长期稳定，建议改为英文 kebab-case。
            </div>

            <form id="metadata-form" class="metadata-form" novalidate>
              <div class="field field-id">
                <label for="field-id">内容 ID <span>文件名与 URL</span></label>
                <input id="field-id" name="id" required autocomplete="off" />
              </div>
              <div class="field field-title">
                <label for="field-title">标题</label>
                <input id="field-title" name="title" required autocomplete="off" />
              </div>

              <div id="course-fields" class="field-grid field-group" hidden>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="field-semester">学期</label>
                  <input id="field-semester" name="semester" placeholder="大二 · 秋" />
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="field-order">排序</label>
                  <input id="field-order" name="order" type="number" step="1" value="0" />
                </div>
                <div class="field field-wide">
                  <label for="field-description">课程简介</label>
                  <textarea id="field-description" name="description" rows="3"></textarea>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div id="article-fields" class="field-group" hidden>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="field-summary">摘要 <span>列表、SEO 与 RSS 使用</span></label>
                  <textarea id="field-summary" name="summary" rows="3"></textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="field-grid field-grid-three">
                  <div class="field">
                    <label for="field-pub-date">发布日期</label>
                    <input id="field-pub-date" name="pubDate" type="date" />
                  </div>
                  <div class="field">
                    <label for="field-updated">更新时间 <span>可选</span></label>
                    <input id="field-updated" name="updated" type="date" />
                  </div>
                  <div id="course-select-field" class="field">
                    <label for="field-course">课程</label>
                    <select id="field-course" name="course"></select>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div id="chapter-field" class="field">
                  <label for="field-chapter">章节</label>
                  <input id="field-chapter" name="chapter" placeholder="第五章 · 树" />
                </div>
                <div class="field">
                  <label for="field-tags">标签 <span>用逗号或回车分隔</span></label>
                  <div class="tag-editor">
                    <div id="tag-chips" class="tag-chips"></div>
                    <input id="field-tags" name="tags" list="tag-suggestions" autocomplete="off" placeholder="输入标签后按回车" />
                    <datalist id="tag-suggestions"></datalist>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="toggle-row">
                  <label class="switch-field">
                    <input id="field-draft" name="draft" type="checkbox" />
                    <span>保存为草稿</span>
                  </label>
                  <label id="featured-field" class="switch-field" hidden>
                    <input id="field-featured" name="featured" type="checkbox" />
                    <span>首页精选</span>
                  </label>
                </div>
              </div>
            </form>

            <section id="markdown-section" class="markdown-section" hidden>
              <div class="markdown-heading">
                <div>
                  <h2>正文</h2>
                  <span id="body-count">0 字</span>
                </div>
                <div class="markdown-toolbar" role="toolbar" aria-label="Markdown 工具">
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="heading" title="二级标题">H2</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="bold" title="粗体"><strong>B</strong></button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="italic" title="斜体"><em>I</em></button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="link" title="链接">↗</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="quote" title="引用">❞</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="list" title="列表">≡</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="code" title="代码块">&lt;/&gt;</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="math" title="数学公式">∑</button>
                  <button type="button" data-markdown="callout" title="Callout">!</button>
                  <button id="image-button" type="button" data-markdown="image" title="上传图片">▧</button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <textarea id="field-body" spellcheck="true" placeholder="从这里开始写 Markdown…"></textarea>
            </section>
          </section>
        </main>

        <aside class="preview-pane" aria-label="内容预览">
          <div class="preview-heading">
            <div>
              <span>实时预览</span>
              <small id="preview-status">等待内容</small>
            </div>
            <button id="refresh-preview" class="icon-button" type="button" title="刷新预览" aria-label="刷新预览">↻</button>
          </div>
          <div id="preview-empty" class="preview-empty">
            <span>文</span>
            <p>选择文章后，这里会按照网站的真实排版渲染。</p>
          </div>
          <iframe id="preview-frame" title="Markdown 实时预览" sandbox="" hidden></iframe>
          <div id="preview-errors" class="preview-errors" hidden></div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <details id="check-panel" class="check-panel">
        <summary>项目检查输出</summary>
        <pre id="check-output">尚未运行 pnpm check。</pre>
      </details>
    </div>

    <dialog id="asset-dialog" class="studio-dialog">
      <form method="dialog">
        <div class="dialog-heading">
          <span class="studio-seal">图</span>
          <div>
            <h2>插入文章图片</h2>
            <p>图片会保存到当前文章的专属资源目录。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <label class="field">
          <span>选择图片</span>
          <input id="asset-file" type="file" accept=".png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.gif,.avif,.svg,image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp,image/gif,image/avif,image/svg+xml" />
        </label>
        <label class="field">
          <span>替代文字</span>
          <input id="asset-alt" placeholder="简要描述图片内容" />
        </label>
        <div class="dialog-actions">
          <button value="cancel" class="button button-quiet">取消</button>
          <button id="upload-asset" value="default" class="button button-primary">上传并插入</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </dialog>

    <div id="toast" class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

    <script is:inline define:vars={{ token }}>
      window.__CONTENT_STUDIO_TOKEN__ = token;
    </script>
    <script>
      import "./client.ts";
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
